	"changelog": "### 1.1.0\n\n* Added a command to ask a question before image description, for engines that support custom prompts. Assign a shortcut in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.\n* Fixed the conversation history caret jumping to the end when new replies arrive, so you can keep your reading position.\n* Automatic recognition now remembers your engine choice for OCR and image description when switching modes or turning automatic recognition off and on.",
